	INFO\nSeason tickets are available. 6-show packages start at just $34 per-
	show. \nTickets are $46 and are available online or by calling TUTS Guest 
	Services at 713-558-8887. Tickets will also available in person Monday thr
	ough Friday from Noon to 6 p.m. at the TUTS Box Office\, located in the Ho
	bby Center lobby. \nDiscounted group tickets are available for parties of 
	10 or more.Theatre Under The Stars has a variety of accessibility options 
	for guests.Learn more about accessible performances and other services her
	e. \nRush tickets will be available for $35 at the box office for mezzanin
	e and gallery seating starting 2 hours prior to curtain. \nQuestions about
	 parking\, dining or other aspects of attending a TUTS show? We’ve got ans
	wers! \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				RUN TIME\n2 hours and 30 minutes 
