UID:7iHO19Gi1tZ0Kx2zywszG
SUMMARY:BigTex Backyard Ultra: Last Runner Standing
DTSTAMP:20260819T033141Z
DTSTART:20261107T130000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Ultimate Test of Grit—4.17 miles every hour until only one 
	runner remains. How far will the Big Tex Backyard go this year?\n\nFrom Te
